ts from carrying out the following row operations on $C?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{3} \\\\ {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+5{R}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's list the required operations:\n\n- The operation ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+3{R}_{3}$ means that we need to add $3$ times the third row to the first row.\n\n- The operation ${R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+5{R}_{3}$ means that we need to add $5$ times the third row to the second row.\n\nApplying the operations, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+3\\cdot {R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1+(3)(2) & 2+(3)(0) & 1+(3)(-1) \\\\ -9 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+5\\cdot {R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -9+(5)(2) & 0+(5)(0) & -4+(5)(-1) \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -9 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-130065/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eb1afe82-86ba-5a15-9037-74717692ecb2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130065"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72781/selection/ec9d7761e1971f45037c5b496f21746003013e8c09df814a6828646641b01f7e" :answer/id #uuid "af5b8fda-c1d1-5c20-84fe-18728c4df6e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72781/selection/c6fcd54fa683fd289dd0db62378c4e07e609a720bb846866f579139d858c160c" :answer/id #uuid "20525e74-cfb6-554f-9f33-c5998b714fa7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db