carrying out the row operation ${R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{1}$ on $N?$" :question/worked-solution "The operation ${R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{1}$ means that we need to add $-2$ times the first row to the second row.\n\nApplying this row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}N & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2+(-2)(1) & 1+(-2)(-2) & 2+(-2)(1) & 3+(-2)(-1) \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72781/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c27a3f3c-77c7-55e9-8714-1f24c4a48063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72781"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130070/selection/ddc3837afe6aaf8a4f8ec8f31b28daa6e183408c59dcebda9c4ecd21d88b747c" :answer/id #uuid "9bf73389-fc62-5b99-8ccc-fa414dbf736e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 9\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130070/selection/de389d44f825cefdb32c3cae9f51180fb7e4fe0835a3e9af19e9892baa60cebf" :answer/id #uuid "e8544bce-f337-50d4-ae5a-e63b72e7a667" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 9 \\\\ 6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130070/selection/0f9646c621649fe7b95f2224d85980511e1d8d6271b77d00657dfbca6c62c114" :answer/id #uuid "d43b8365-16f7-503d-83bb-4a18510b2877" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 9 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130070/selection/a744a9616c87b144b1562a366e0c6d82619fd1b00a0a909b9f8e02c08787e1ca" :answer/id #uuid "e41b9691-4